## On the job {.unnumbered}

::: callout-important
## Why this matters day to day

Every People Analytics deliverable opens with a **description of the
data**: how many people, what the key variables look like, and where
the gaps are. Before any model, a business stakeholder wants to know
you *understand what you're working with* — exactly what a thesis
examiner wants to see, just with a different audience.
